WEBVTT

NOTE
Brief transition scene following the failed assassination. Squall and the team react to the sudden failure of their plan. Action shifts to direct confrontation with Edea on the parade float. Duration: approximately 8 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Squall moves with sudden urgency on a rooftop or elevated platform overlooking the parade route. His expression shifts from controlled focus to decisive action. He draws his gunblade with a metallic ring, the blade extending in full combat configuration.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Squall launches himself from the rooftop, leaping through the air toward the parade float moving beneath him. His body is silhouetted against the darkening Deling City skyline. His trajectory is perfectly calculated.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Squall lands hard on the ornate surface of the parade float. The impact creates a visible disturbance. The float shudders slightly from his weight. Around him, decorations and columns frame the float's elaborate structure. Edea's presence is felt on the float, though not visible in this immediate moment.
